  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Similar thread from 2019: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/option-to-lock-avatar-favorites-to-prevent-accidental-unfavoriting\nThe UI has changed drastically since then, and will change again even later after this Canny post, and so I hope this suggestion will be put into mind after the UI update for the Launchpad and Wings menus.\nThe current Favorite/Unfavorite Avatar button has always been close to the \"Change Avatar\" and \"Avatar Stats\" buttons, and I have caught myself losing avatars that I intended to keep. An \"Are you sure you wish to unfavorite this avatar?\" screen could be implemented to prevent further inconveniences such as this scenario.",
